{"id":"631106","name":"三色藜麦全麦馒头","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/631106/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"全麦粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"三色藜麦","amount":"60克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"温牛奶","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好60克三色藜麦，清洗干净，提前用水泡2个小时以上。","img":"images/631106/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"藜麦沥干水分。","img":"images/631106/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"全麦粉倒入大碗中。","img":"images/631106/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入酵母、一个鸡蛋，100克温牛奶，搅拌成棉絮。","img":"images/631106/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入泡好的藜麦。","img":"images/631106/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌成面絮。","img":"images/631106/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再揉成光滑的面团，放温暖处发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/631106/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"发酵好的面团，整理排气。","img":"images/631106/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"分成均匀的8等分。","img":"images/631106/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取出一个面团，搓成稍高的馒头形状，馒头生胚就好了。","img":"images/631106/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"依次做完，摆入蒸锅中，中间留出空隙，再次醒发20分钟。","img":"images/631106/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"凉水上锅，出气后，大火蒸15分钟，关火，再虚蒸3～5分钟。","img":"images/631106/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/631106/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631106/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631106/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631106/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/631106/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}